header><strong class=3D"style_chapter__grtAe">05</strong><h1>Stock trading =
app</h1></header><p>Stock trading apps tackle some unique technical challen=
ges. They're not just another app. They're fast-moving platforms where timi=
ng is everything, and getting accurate, real-time information to users imme=
diately can make a huge difference in their financial decisions. Figure 1 s=
hows some of the most popular stock trading apps in the industry.</p>
