<h4 id=3D"notifications">Notifications</h4>
<p>To support price alerts, we include:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>GET /v1/notifications</strong><br>
gets all created alerts.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>POST /v1/notifications</strong><br>
