</li>
<li>
<p><strong>DELETE /v1/notifications/<code>{id}</code></strong><br>
deletes an existing alert.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"websocket-connection">WebSocket connection</h4>
<p>For real-time functionality, we establish a WebSocket connection at wss:=
