<h2 id=3D"step-3-high-level-client-architecture">Step 3: High-level client =
architecture</h2>
<p>With our API design in place, let's develop the high-level mobile archit=
ecture. Figure 3 illustrates this architecture, with arrows showing the flo=
w of data through the system.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a mobile application architecture diagram. =
 The diagram is divided into a client-side and a server-side. The client-si=
de, labeled 'Client,' contains a 'UI layer' with components: 'Home Screen,'=
